 "result": "I documented 12 repos this run: ghost-kitchen-builder, restack, tinewood-keys, ebutuoy-frontend, ebutuoy-backend, cockpit-racer, pixelmill, coffee-autosim, birdix, page-wide-pof, pixelcoop-farm and aliens-win.\n\nEach got a README, a CHANGELOG and a publish job, and I pushed them to the default branch. 53 backfills remain. The next ones are synth, ether-wand, pajamastan-invoices and torque-converter.\n\nRestack keeps its app in a public folder with no root vercel.json, so I checked the live site after the push. It still returns 200. The profile README in sudosilo/sudosilo is rebuilt and pushed. The scribe state and the agent notes are committed to control-troll main.\n\nThe only repo with no Control Troll app was page-wide-pof. I amended its commit to drop the \"checked every morning\" line, since it isn't monitored. I also added six agent repos to repos.json with empty apps. I could reach every repo.",
